Package: qslegacy
Type: Package
Title: Read Legacy QS Lists of Matrices
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(person("Travers", "Ching", role="aut"),
    person("Michael", "Thrun", email="mthrun@mathematik.uni-marburg.de", role="cre"),
    person("Yann", "Collet", role=c("ctb", "cph")),
    person("Facebook, Inc.", role="cph"),
    person("Francesc", "Alted", role=c("ctb", "cph")))
Description: A read-only compatibility reader for lists of matrices stored in
    the legacy qs format. Runs in the current R process using supported R APIs,
    including R 4.6. It has no file-writing or general R-object deserialization
    interface. Derived from the qs 0.27.3 format and bundled compression code.
License: GPL-3
Depends: R (>= 3.5.0)
Imports: Rcpp
LinkingTo: Rcpp
SystemRequirements: C++17
Encoding: UTF-8
NeedsCompilation: yes
